			"notes": "### 1.8beta7\n\n**1.8beta7更新**\n其他维护者更新\n1. 美化CilckGUI\n2. 歌词上岛\n3. 修复部分设备无法正常显示灵动岛\n4. 新增tps/time/ping hud\n5. 为autologin增加新的检测模式\n6. 歌词显示hud在new/blur样式下可配置圆角。\n\n**1.8beta7 Update**\nUpdates from other maintainers\n1. Beautified ClickGUI\n2. Lyrics on the Dynamic Island\n3. Fixed the Dynamic Island not displaying properly on some devices\n4. Added tps/time/ping HUD\n5. Added a new detection mode for autologin\n6. The lyrics display HUD can now have configurable corner radius under the new/blur styles."
		},
