			"notes": "### 1.8beta6更新\n**其他维护者更新：**\n1. 自动登录服务器\n2. 把主题页面的文字颜色修复了\n3. 重写.help 格式\n4. 前缀为 / 时优先显示客户端指令\n5. 更新模块增加 ghfast.top 镜像\n6. 移除所有 IRC 及其相关配置 / 功能\n7. 修复了 nickname 的崩溃问题\n8. 恢复前一次提交被覆盖的内容\n\n**Other maintainer changes:**\n1. Auto‑login to servers\n2. Fixed text color on the theme page\n3. Rewrote .help format\n4. Prioritize displaying client‑side commands when prefix starts with /\n5. Added shturl.cc/ mirror for the update module\n6. Removed all IRC and its related configurations/features\n7. Fixed nickname crash issue\n8. Restored content overwritten in the previous commit\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1040\" alt=\"c9dee92ffe71a143724fcaab4acd7e8c\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/999fafb6-e054-4e24-80f7-fa60edbfa056\" />\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1040\" alt=\"80e1acabef33f5e3a6282af1f2566664\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/56cebb13-2533-4360-9d74-828568b5045a\" />\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1040\" alt=\"611af94dc487ea0a8a29a6b409379570\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5f2ef296-f31c-4774-9917-b7d6e2e2a348\" />\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1040\" alt=\"a4b5ca524eb848f66a3188429134ccef\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c2f431a0-61ed-4314-b26e-f4ec2e408f2d\" />\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1040\" alt=\"e25d00b572ba66b389aa143f6200c0b6\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b6390216-aff2-4bdc-9c63-718774ffcbb2\" />\n<img width=\"129\" height=\"196\" alt=\"1dcb65b1d560290e69e34a41eb698b59\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/790a06bd-0b91-48b6-81a5-be6c46784fc3\" />"
