			"notes": "- Added Dynamic Island support: long-press the TAB key to expand the player list via Dynamic Island. Use /PVPUtlis clientname xxx to change the displayed client name.\n- Added Blur mode for TargetHUD and Blockcount.\n- Added physical item drops.\n- Added 2D rendering for dropped items.\n- Migrated custom capes from the Render section to the Tools section.\n- Optimized performance.\n- Fixed a bug that caused in-game item icons to disappear in some cases.\n- Added the ability to change in-game time and weather.\n- Added attack target effects: customizable particle effects when attacking a target.\n- Added global theme switching.\n- Added the /PVPUtlis help command.\n- Added Better chat.\n- Added smooth hotbar.\n- Optimized input method conflict fixes.\n- Fixed an issue where certain devices were unconditionally locked to the English keyboard when input method conflict fixes were enabled.\n- Added armor HUD."
